### Запросы через Gateway (http://localhost:5000/api/bookings/...).
### Токен: POST http://localhost:8080/realms/booking-platform/protocol/openid-connect/token
###   grant_type=password, client_id=booking-api, client_secret=your-client-secret,
###   username=testuser|adminuser, password=password

@Gateway = http://localhost:5000/api/bookings
@Token = <access_token>
@ResourceId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@OfferId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@BookingId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Получить токен testuser
POST http://localhost:8080/realms/booking-platform/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=booking-api&client_secret=your-client-secret&username=testuser&password=password

### Свободные слоты
GET {{Gateway}}/slots?resourceId={{ResourceId}}&offerId={{OfferId}}&from=2026-11-10&to=2026-11-12
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### Создать бронь
POST {{Gateway}}
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "resourceId": "{{ResourceId}}",
  "offerId": "{{OfferId}}",
  "startAt": "2026-11-10T07:00:00Z",
  "comment": "Тестовая бронь"
}

### Мои брони
GET {{Gateway}}?status=Confirmed
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### Бронь по id
GET {{Gateway}}/{{BookingId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### История брони
GET {{Gateway}}/{{BookingId}}/history
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### Отменить бронь
POST {{Gateway}}/{{BookingId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Планы изменились"
}

### Подтвердить бронь (booking-admin)
POST {{Gateway}}/{{BookingId}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### Отклонить бронь (booking-admin)
POST {{Gateway}}/{{BookingId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Ресурс на обслуживании"
}

### Брони ресурса за период (booking-admin)
GET {{Gateway}}/resources/{{ResourceId}}?from=2026-11-01T00:00:00Z&to=2026-12-01T00:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
